                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Panitumumab 100 mg/5 mL concentrate for solution for infusion is recommended for inclusion on the MOH Standard Drug List (SDL) for the abovementioned indication with effect from 4 January 2022."
